  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5097c7ab-4d20-48be-a8a6-ef7b92d54c7e"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the total fiber bijection along a base walk as an association from \
each starting vertex to the endpoint of its horizontal lift.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"d315dfda-0174-4ab1-a009-571dc1ccf214"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraParallelTransport"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraParallelTransport", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"InfraDisplacementBundle", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["graph", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["radius", "TI"]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["walk", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9f837e84-11c2-4786-a836-32eb862b0ed9"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the list of metric-selected transports in the Experimental \
displacement-bundle model.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"9de33661-cd5a-4fe6-bfa1-175c43fa3fd3"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraParallelTransport"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraParallelTransport", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
